        "effective_from": "2024-07-01",
        "quote": "7.3 Condonation. Subject to clause 7.2, the Dean (Academics) may condone a shortage of attendance of up to 10% on medical grounds, supported by a medical certificate submitted within seven days of resuming classes. Condonation is not granted for laboratory courses."
